decode the all-ones bit pattern to 0 instead of -1
decoded = -1;
----
decoded = 0;
====
sign-extend with one bit too few
decoded = decoded | (-1 << bits);
----
decoded = decoded | (-1 << (bits - 1));
====
miss the sign bit test of the signed reader
if ((decoded & (1 << (bits - 1))) == (1 << (bits - 1)))
----
